it/commits/ece2644cd2b7ba840072a711d0bf3fc999f7e9c4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ArturoZvezda/mef-frontend-arquetipo/commit/ece2644cd2b7ba840072a711d0bf3fc999f7e9c4","node_id":"C_kwDOPiFEZNoAKGVjZTI2NDRjZDJiN2JhODQwMDcyYTcxMWQwYmYzZmM5OTlmN2U5YzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ArturoZvezda/mef-frontend-arquetipo/commit/e1396d86d7948436ba63ce56d2970abcf7e50ac0","sha":"e1396d86d7948436ba63ce56d2970abcf7e50ac0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArturoZvezda/mef-frontend-arquetipo/commits/e1396d86d7948436ba63ce56d2970abcf7e50ac0"}],"sha":"ece2644cd2b7ba840072a711d0bf3fc999f7e9c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArturoZvezda/mef-frontend-arquetipo/commits/ece2644cd2b7ba840072a711d0bf3fc999f7e9c4"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArturoZvezda/mef-frontend-arquetipo/commits/e1396d86d7948436ba63ce56d2970abcf7e50ac0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-22T11:31:37Z","email":"dev.generico2@gmail.com","name":"Dev Generico IG"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-22T11:31:37Z","email":"dev.generico2@gmail.com","name":"Dev Generico IG"},"message":"feat: implementar Event-Driven Design completo con Domain Events\n\n- Domain Events: UserCreatedEvent, ProductReservedEvent, ProductStockUpdatedEvent\n- Event Bus completo con RxJS para pub/sub asíncrono\n- Event Handlers: UserCreatedHandler, ProductReservedHandler\n- Event Handler Registry para registro automático de handlers\n- Event-Driven Demo Component para probar eventos en tiempo real\n- Enhanced Dashboard con información de Event-Driven Architecture\n- Actualización de NotificationPort con NotificationData structure\n- Casos de uso publican eventos automáticamente tras operaciones exitosas\n\nCaracterísticas Event-Driven implementadas:\n✅ Domain Events tipados con payload específico\n✅ Event Bus con RxJS Observable pattern\n✅ Event Handlers con side effects (emails, logging, métricas)\n✅ Event subscription/unsubscription automático\n✅ Event logging y monitoring en tiempo real\n✅ Batch event publishing para transacciones\n✅ Error handling en event processing\n✅ Integration con infrastructure adapters\n\nArquitectura completa: DDD + Hexagonal + Event-Driven + CQRS patterns\n\n🤖 Generated with Claude Code\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7ff228829f2d2d5741da72ef07d246ddb1177e92","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArturoZvezda/mef-frontend-arquetipo/git/trees/7ff228829f2d2d5741da72ef07d246ddb1177e92"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArturoZvezda/mef-frontend-arquetipo/git/commits/e1396d86d7948436ba63ce56d2970abcf7e50ac0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ArturoZvezda/mef-frontend-arquetipo/commit/e1396d86d7948436ba63ce56d2970abcf7e50ac0","node_id":"C_kwDOPiFEZNoAKGUxMzk2ZDg2ZDc5NDg0MzZiYTYzY2U1NmQyOTcwYWJjZjdlNTBhYzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ArturoZvezda/mef-frontend-arquetipo/commit/4ddc0ade0c03d7b9f1d3f785536169faad9911fc","sha":"4ddc0ade0c03d7b9f1d3f785536169faad9911fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArturoZvezda/mef-frontend-arquetipo/commits/4ddc0ade0c03d7b9f1d3f785536169faad9911fc"}],"sha":"e1396d86d7948436ba63ce56d2970abcf7e50ac0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArturoZvezda/mef-frontend-arquetipo/commits/e1396d86d7948436ba63ce56d2970abcf7e50ac0"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArturoZvezda/mef-frontend-arquetipo/commits/4ddc0ade0c03d7b9f1d3f785536169faad9911fc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-21T23:07:47Z","email":"dev.generico2@gmail.com","name":"Dev Generico IG"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-21T23:07:47Z","email":"dev.generico2@gmail.com","name":"Dev Generico IG"},"message":"docs: agregar instrucciones completas del arquetipo\n\n- Guía paso a paso para recrear el arquetipo desde cero\n- PASO 7: Configuración de Tailwind CSS v3 agregada\n- Instrucciones detalladas de instalación y configuración\n- Incluye todos los comandos necesarios para setup completo\n\n🤖 Generated with Claude Code\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e0cc1f284fb178b7eb884e3ef9b78e408240dedb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArturoZvezda/mef-frontend-arquetipo/git/trees/e0cc1f284fb178b7eb884e3ef9b78e408240dedb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArturoZvezda/mef-frontend-arquetipo/git/commits/4ddc0ade0c03d7b9f1d3f785536169faad9911fc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ArturoZvezda/mef-frontend-arquetipo/commit/4ddc0ade0c03d7b9f1d3f785536169faad9911fc","node_id":"C_kwDOPiFEZNoAKDRkZGMwYWRlMGMwM2Q3YjlmMWQzZjc4NTUzNjE2OWZhYWQ5OTExZmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ArturoZvezda/mef-frontend-arquetipo/commit/a8eeb91c742e4eaa705c36946205388812004581","sha":"a8eeb91c742e4eaa705c36946205388812004581","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArturoZvezda/mef-frontend-arquetipo/commits/a8eeb91c742e4eaa705c36946205388812004581"}],"sha":"4ddc0ade0c03d7b9f1d3f785536169faad9911fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArturoZvezda/mef-frontend-arquetipo/commits/4ddc0ade0c03d7b9f1d3f785536169faad9911fc"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArturoZvezda/mef-frontend-arquetipo/commits/a8eeb91c742e4eaa705c36946205388812004581/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-21T23:06:29Z","email":"dev.generico2@gmail.com","name":"Dev Generico IG"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-21T23:06:29Z","email":"dev.generico2@gmail.com","name":"Dev Generico IG"},"message":"feat: implementar arquetipo Angular 18 LTS con DDD + Arquitectura Hexagonal\n\n- Angular 18 LTS con TypeScript 5.8 en modo strict\n- Arquitectura Hexagonal con separación de capas (Domain, Application, Infrastructure)\n- Domain-Driven Design con entidades, value objects y casos de uso\n- Native Federation para microfrontends (Host + Catalog)\n- TanStack Query + Angular Signals para gestión de estado\n- Tailwind CSS v3 para styling moderno y responsive\n- Jest + Playwright para testing completo\n- Nx workspace para monorepo escalable\n\nCaracterísticas principales:\n✅ Implementación completa de DDD con User y Product agregados\n✅ Casos de uso: CreateUser, GetUsers, ReserveProductStock\n✅ Adaptadores: HTTP, LocalStorage, Notifications, EventBus\n✅ Dashboard funcional con todas las arquitecturas integradas\n✅ Componentes UI con Tailwind CSS y animaciones\n✅ Testing setup con Jest y mocking con datos simulados\n✅ Documentación completa del arquetipo y guías de implementación\n\n🤖 Generated with Claude Code\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cbe2edc964fedf9994681378af4a5241af73a1e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArturoZvezda/mef-frontend-arquetipo/git/trees/cbe2edc964fedf9994681378af4a5241af73a1e3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArturoZvezda/mef-frontend-arquetipo/git/commits/a8eeb91c742e4eaa705c36946205388812004581","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ArturoZvezda/mef-frontend-arquetipo/commit/a8eeb91c742e4eaa705c36946205388812004581","node_id":"C_kwDOPiFEZNoAKGE4ZWViOTFjNzQyZTRlYWE3MDVjMzY5NDYyMDUzODg4MTIwMDQ1ODE","parents":[],"sha":"a8eeb91c742e4eaa705c36946205388812004581","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArturoZvezda/mef-frontend-arquetipo/commits/a8eeb91c742e4eaa705c36946205388812004581"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArturoZvezda/mef-frontend-arquetipo/commits?per_page=100&page=1&sha=717aaa00d78eb2c632936a136f3e19f32c7f0c69&since=2025-03-31T23%3A59%3A59.000Z&until=2026-10-08T15%3A39%3A28.319Z"}');
