oft2-P1-Frontend/commits/4b80d383765ec9ddc19cc870e8475f65596a2a18/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-03T08:17:37Z","email":"steve10090@gmail.com","name":"Kevin Steve Quezada Ordoñez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-03T08:17:37Z","email":"steve10090@gmail.com","name":"Kevin Steve Quezada Ordoñez"},"message":"ci(frontend): migrar flujo CI/CD de GHCR a AWS ECR y despliegue en EC2\n\nSe actualiza el workflow de construcción del frontend para almacenar las imágenes Docker en AWS ECR en lugar de GHCR.\nSe reemplazan los pasos de GitHub Container Registry por configuración de credenciales de AWS, autenticación en ECR y ejecución de scripts de despliegue.\n\nEl frontend ahora se despliega automáticamente en una instancia EC2 vía SSH al hacer push en la rama main, habilitando un flujo CI/CD completamente integrado con la infraestructura de AWS.","tree":{"sha":"92d47a1a0b70ec21ea826dd844e52dd1c86485a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/steve-quezada/IngeSoft2-P1-Frontend/git/trees/92d47a1a0b70ec21ea826dd844e52dd1c86485a4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/steve-quezada/IngeSoft2-P1-Frontend/git/commits/4b80d383765ec9ddc19cc870e8475f65596a2a18","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/80070698?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/steve-quezada/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/steve-quezada/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/steve-quezada/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/steve-quezada/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/steve-quezada","id":80070698,"login":"steve-quezada","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgwMDcwNjk4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/steve-quezada/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/steve-quezada/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/use