@gmail.com","name":"Immanuel Mwendia Maina"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-21T23:12:33Z","email":"imaina671@gmail.com","name":"Immanuel Mwendia Maina"},"message":"feat: Complete UI modernization and functionality implementation\n\n- Fixed v-model error in BulkOutbox.vue with proper TypeScript interfaces\n- Updated sidebar icons: Topup (credit card) and API Keys (lock) for better UX\n- Implemented functional contact group actions (Create, Edit, Campaign, Delete)\n- Added Premium Outbox page with full UI and mock data\n- Updated Bulk Topups to use KSh currency and M-Pesa payment option\n- Enhanced Transactions page with KSh currency and PDF receipt generation\n- Made API key generation, copy, and revoke buttons functional\n- Improved dashboard charts and performance metrics visualization\n- Enhanced sidebar navigation with collapsible sections and responsive design\n- Added comprehensive mock data across all components for better demo experience","tree":{"sha":"c150b24a178b46dad39d5a763d2f937824d2527a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kiidfreak/Wevas-Client/git/trees/c150b24a178b46dad39d5a763d2f937824d2527a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kiidfreak/Wevas-Client/git/commits/d3a91a966f748f23977fc1a8adada279593130cf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59394569?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiidfreak/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiidfreak/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiidfreak/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiidfreak/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kiidfreak","id":59394569,"login":"kiidfreak","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5Mzk0NTY5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiidfreak/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiidfreak/received_event