_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hemant-rao/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hemant-rao/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hemant-rao/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hemant-rao","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hemant-rao/universal-toast-message/commits/205cbb34033b1edd1180640080c64ea48d1182a7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-29T11:00:05Z","email":"mrhrao@gmail.com","name":"mrhrao@gmail.com"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-29T11:00:05Z","email":"mrhrao@gmail.com","name":"mrhrao@gmail.com"},"message":"Inline the default icons and cap the expanded toast to the viewport\n\nIcons now come from src/icons.js as data URIs instead of .svg imports, so the\nfirst toast of each type animates in with its icon already present and the\npackage no longer needs an asset loader in the consumer''s bundler.\n\nThe expanded message body also gets a hard viewport ceiling on top of\nexpandedMaxHeight, so a long message can no longer push the close button off\nthe bottom of the screen.","tree":{"sha":"8f744a69c25e311e540b745df7c426c98492494a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hemant-rao/universal-toast-message/git/trees/8f744a69c25e311e540b745df7c426c98492494a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hemant-rao/universal-toast-message/git/commits/205cbb34033b1edd1180640080c64ea48d1182a7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60376898?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hemant-rao/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hemant-rao/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hemant-rao/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hemant-rao/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://githu