-toast-message/commit/6541272cc3f593450c651c81cef77fa7e690ab01","node_id":"C_kwDOPiXh4NoAKDY1NDEyNzJjYzNmNTkzNDUwYzY1MWM4MWNlZjc3ZmE3ZTY5MGFiMDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hemant-rao/universal-toast-message/commit/8b107ba6ad4dc8f71ce1c631bb00addfa006af64","sha":"8b107ba6ad4dc8f71ce1c631bb00addfa006af64","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hemant-rao/universal-toast-message/commits/8b107ba6ad4dc8f71ce1c631bb00addfa006af64"}],"sha":"6541272cc3f593450c651c81cef77fa7e690ab01","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hemant-rao/universal-toast-message/commits/6541272cc3f593450c651c81cef77fa7e690ab01"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60376898?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hemant-rao/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hemant-rao/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hemant-rao/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hemant-rao/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hemant-rao","id":60376898,"login":"hemant-rao","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMzc2ODk4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hemant-rao/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hemant-rao/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hemant-rao/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hemant-rao/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hemant-rao/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hemant-rao","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hemant-rao/universal-toast-message/commits/8b107ba6ad4dc8f71ce1c631bb00addfa006af64/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-29T08:57:25Z","email":"mrhrao@gmail.com","name":"mrhrao@gmail.com"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-29T08:57:25Z","email":"mrhrao@gmail.com","name":"mrhrao@gmail.com"},"message":"Add a full theming layer: positions, animations, expandable messages\n\nEverything here is opt-in — the built-in defaults still reproduce the\noriginal 350px, square-cornered, shadowless toast exactly.\n\n- src/defaults.js (new) owns BASE_DEFAULTS, the four type palettes,\n  type aliases (error/danger/toast-danger all normalise to one type)\n  and mergeOptions(). Resolution order is BASE_DEFAULTS < app.use\n  options < types[type] < per-call options.\n- Six positions, each with its own flow-based fixed stack, so a toast\n  is only as tall as its content and survivors glide on removal.\n- Long messages clamp to N lines with a See more toggle; expanding\n  cancels the auto-hide timers and scrolls past expandedMaxHeight.\n- One shared keyframe pair drives every animation, with direction and\n  scale passed in as CSS custom properties derived from position.\n- Timer duration and CSS duration both come from animationDuration,\n  so they can no longer drift apart.\n- pauseOnHover, close(id), clear(), setDefaults(), and per-call skins\n  (colours, radius, shadow, accent bar, icons, background images).\n\nVerified against the demo bench: lint and production build clean, all\ntoast types, stacking, sticky toasts, expand/collapse, custom skins\nand all six positions render correctly with no console errors.","tree":{"sha":"6e7a72c15e53a4470a72aee08d79c9709e54001c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hemant-rao/universal-toast-message/git/trees/6e7a72c15e53a4470a72aee08d79c9709e54001c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hemant-rao/universal-toast-message/git/commits/8b107ba6ad4dc8f71ce1c631bb00addfa006af64","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60376898?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hemant-rao/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hemant-rao/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hemant-rao/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"h