o@gmail.com","name":"mrhrao@gmail.com"},"message":"Honour the duration option and keep the tarball lean\n\ntoast.js and the README already exposed a `duration` argument, but\nToastComponent.showToast ignored it and always hid after a hard-coded\n8000ms, so the option was a no-op in the published package. Accept it\nnow, and treat duration <= 0 as \"stay until closed manually\".\n\nAlso track each toast''s timers so removeToast and beforeUnmount can\nclear them, make the close button run the slide-out animation instead\nof removing the node outright, and drop the duplicate static class the\n:class binding already sets.\n\npackage.json: drop the stale \"assets\" files entry (assets live under\nsrc/) and exclude the 293kB README demo gif from the tarball -- the\nREADME links it from raw.githubusercontent, so shipping it only bloated\nthe package from 5.8kB to 295kB.","tree":{"sha":"e047314dfd8e67b3289bea916d860f4684a7d017","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hemant-rao/universal-toast-message/git/trees/e047314dfd8e67b3289bea916d860f4684a7d017"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hemant-rao/universal-toast-message/git/commits/8e0424b9389c99d5af543b785a78459d76c69ee2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60376898?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hemant-rao/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hemant-rao/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hemant-rao/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hemant-rao/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hemant-rao","id":60376898,"login":"hemant-rao","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMzc2ODk4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hemant-rao/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hemant-rao/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hemant-rao/repos","sit