seSharedStateSelector` hook\n\nIntroduced a new `useSharedStateSelector` hook to enhance state management capabilities by enabling efficient state selection with memoization. Added `react-fast-compare` to improve deep comparison performance.\n\n- Added `useSharedStateSelector` for selecting and memoizing shared state slices.\n- Used `react-fast-compare` for optimized equality checks.\n- Updated `package.json` and `pnpm-lock.yaml` to include `react-fast-compare`.\n- Removed unused `pnpm-workspace.yaml`.\n- Updated `vite` version to `7.1.5` to align with dependencies.","tree":{"sha":"05e90acc3c7c6fb0ae84a5204812469a32f8621f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HichemTab-tech/react-shared-states/git/trees/05e90acc3c7c6fb0ae84a5204812469a32f8621f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HichemTab-tech/react-shared-states/git/commits/87d8eb86c16af13471fd379caad26568ee4cc067","verification":{"payload":"tree 05e90acc3c7c6fb0ae84a5204812469a32f8621f\nparent ab61d2c41017af076581a4e6bb8f54d0e7f19c15\nauthor HichemTab-tech <konanhichemsinshi@gmail.com> 1758751787 +0100\ncommitter HichemTab-tech <konanhichemsinshi@gmail.com> 1758751787 +0100\n\nAdd `useSharedStateSelector` hook\n\nIntroduced a new `useSharedStateSelector` hook to enhance state management capabilities by enabling efficient state selection with memoization. Added `react-fast-compare` to improve deep comparison performance.\n\n- Added `useSharedStateSelector` for selecting and memoizing shared state slices.\n- Used `react-fast-compare` for optimized equality checks.\n- Updated `package.json` and `pnpm-lock.yaml` to include `react-fast-compare`.\n- Removed unused `pnpm-workspace.yaml`.\n- Updated `vite` version to `7.1.5` to align with dependencies.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCAAdFiEEc8u0Ai98RuJ1xSRsnycATbcPOU8FAmjUbCsACgkQnycATbcP\nOU/UJw/+MMX/Ho7l6UCBe6BGFmKAFayYa651U/4NAsXraSVPMtLdJvH2h9ttOYtA\nZ6n1UJPyp6079qKFFSPccWTT2n+pt3IkdfM83JA4rvAByG+ELkIMTlmEY+QYIEZ0\n0keD/W7h/