os/ProjectHub-fie/ProjectHub/commits/05412723b186ca0568fc796c955e870fa0a7439c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T10:09:13Z","email":"openhands@all-hands.dev","name":"openhands"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T10:09:13Z","email":"openhands@all-hands.dev","name":"openhands"},"message":"Rename &dev to &profile with &pr alias and build profile embed\n\nRename the existing developer command to a profile-information command,\npreserving its role lookup and removing &dev as a usable command/alias.\n\n- &profile (alias &pr) replies with one embed: static brand author icon,\n  the caller''s real Discord avatar as the embed image above the fields,\n  and a footer with the requester and a Discord relative timestamp.\n- Fields: Name, Username, Role, Account Created, Server Joined,\n  Invited By, Discord Linked, each with a clean fallback.\n- Role is the admin credential role when the id is found, else member.\n- Discord Linked distinguishes linked / not linked / no account yet.\n- Invite attribution via invite-use diffing on guildMemberAdd, seeded at\n  ClientReady, stored in bot_invite_joins and bot_invite_uses.\n- Move all message and command handling into bot/events/messageCreate.js;\n  bot/index.js is now only the process shell.\n- Set the bot activity to watching ProjectHub.inc.\n- Update dashboard, docs and tests; no &dev references remain.\n\nCo-authored-by: openhands <openhands@all-hands.dev>","tree":{"sha":"3165cd0852dc93fdad589ecaafbb93c1582f66a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ProjectHub-fie/ProjectHub/git/trees/3165cd0852dc93fdad589ecaafbb93c1582f66a8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ProjectHub-fie/ProjectHub/git/commits/05412723b186ca0568fc796c955e870fa0a7439c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/175740463?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/events{/privacy}","