v","name":"openhands"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T08:55:46Z","email":"openhands@all-hands.dev","name":"openhands"},"message":"Stop .vercelignore from stripping deployed modules; make the bot install fit a small host\n\nTwo independent deploy failures, both invisible to a local test run.\n\n1. Vercel: ERR_MODULE_NOT_FOUND for api/_lib/test-routes.js\n\n.vercelignore uses gitignore semantics, where a pattern with no slash matches at\nANY depth. A bare ''test*'' therefore deleted api/_lib/test-routes.js out of the\nserverless bundle while api/admin/index.js still imported it, and the function\ndied at load. The file was present on disk, so no local run could see it.\n\n- Renamed the helper to api/_lib/suite-runner.js, so no ignore glob can reach it\n  even if the patterns regress.\n- Anchored the ignore entries (/tests/, /test*.js, /*-test.js) and replaced the\n  recursive-looking ''testing/'' and ''temp-tests/'' with explicit **/ forms.\n- tests/deployment-limits.test.mjs now reads the real .vercelignore and matches\n  it against the real api/ tree: no unanchored glob may hit a segment under api/,\n  every api/ file must survive, and every relative import of both entry points\n  must resolve to a non-ignored path. One test pins the footgun itself by\n  asserting the old pattern matched at depth, so the guard cannot rot quietly.\n\n2. Bot host: ''Killed npm install'' then Cannot find package ''discord.js''\n\nThe panel runs a full npm install before every boot. That pulls the frontend\ntoolchain plus the vercel (279 packages) and gh (240) CLIs, which exceeds the\ncontainer''s memory; the kernel kills the install, and the bot then cannot find\ndiscord.js even though it is declared. Nothing in the tree imports vercel or gh.\n\n- Moved vercel and gh to devDependencies. discord.js stays a runtime dependency.\n- Added engines.node >= 20. discord.js needs node:-prefixed built-ins, and the\n  first crash log was Node 19.\n- Added npm run bot:prod-install (install --omit=dev): 698 packages, verified to\n  resolve discord.js and the bot''s whole import chain from a clean tree.\n- Documented both in bot/README.md and the .vercelignore trap in AGENTS.md.\n\nFull suite 297 tests, 256 pass, 41 skipped, 0 fail. tsc and build clean.\n\nCo-authored-by: openhands <openhands@all-hands.dev>","tree":{"sha":"8ceab481d2fcf3642766651a83ce0f0cdede067d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ProjectHub-fie/ProjectHub/git/trees/8ceab481d2fcf3642766651a83ce0f0cdede067d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ProjectHub-fie/ProjectHub/git/commits/59130df69c67863c1f4244efd0341a02c308750e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/175740463?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/openhands-agent","id":175740463,"login":"openhands-agent","node_id":"U_kgDOCnmWLw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ProjectHub-fie/ProjectHub/commit/59130df69c67863c1f4244efd0341a02c308750e","node_id":"C_kwDOPjAFOtoAKDU5MTMwZGY2OWM2Nzg2M2MxZjQyNDRlZmQwMzQxYTAyYzMwODc1MGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ProjectHub-fie/Pr