gent","id":175740463,"login":"openhands-agent","node_id":"U_kgDOCnmWLw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ProjectHub-fie/ProjectHub/commits/5af9fd434d43ab74bb18f65b0a0cb8ba857b48aa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T06:27:02Z","email":"openhands@all-hands.dev","name":"openhands"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T06:27:02Z","email":"openhands@all-hands.dev","name":"openhands"},"message":"Fix the reset email link/button and mail builder hyperlinks\n\nReset email:\n- The call-to-action is now a single styled anchor carrying the dynamic\n  reset URL instead of an anchor nested in a wrapper table, which some\n  clients flatten and lose. The URL is repeated below as an underlined\n  link and again as plain text, so a client that refuses anchors still\n  leaves a usable address; the old fallback used text-decoration:none\n  and read as ordinary text.\n- Label the button \"Reset Password\".\n- The reset page reads ?email= and ?token= from the emailed link. It was\n  seeding state inside a render-phase useState callback, which is\n  discarded, so the fields arrived empty.\n- Warn that the mail may be in the spam/junk folder in the success toast.\n\nMail builder:\n- Track the editor selection and restore it before createLink, since the\n  URL prompt moves focus and leaves execCommand with no target.\n- When nothing is selected, insert an anchor whose text is the URL rather\n  than issuing a no-op createLink, which made the toolbar button look\n  broken.\n- Escape the entered URL before it is inserted into href/src, for links\n  and images alike.","tree":{"sha":"e6277af0491ecab05a0b0e77c88bf0522700d9d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ProjectHub-fie/ProjectHub/git/trees/e6277af0491ecab05a0b0e77c88bf0522700d9d9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ProjectHub-fie/ProjectHub/git/commits/5af9fd434d43ab74bb18f65b0a0cb8ba857b48aa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/175740463?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/openhands-agent","id":175740463,"login":"openhands-agent","node_id":"U_kgDOCnmWLw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ProjectHub-fie/ProjectHub/commit/5af9fd434d43ab74bb18f65b0a0cb8ba857b48aa","node_id":"C_kwDOPjAFOtoAKDVhZjlmZDQzNGQ0M2FiNzRiYjE4ZjY1YjBhMGNiOGJhODU3YjQ4YWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ProjectHub-fie/ProjectHub/commit/c8dadaad406e8616ce02b4ff680bb9bd0a1617c6","sha":"c8dadaad406e8616ce02b4ff680bb9bd0a1617c6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ProjectHub-fie/ProjectHub/commits/c8dadaad406e8616ce02b4ff680bb9bd0a1617c6"}],"sha":"5