m/u/175740463?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/openhands-agent","id":175740463,"login":"openhands-agent","node_id":"U_kgDOCnmWLw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ProjectHub-fie/ProjectHub/commits/e5c30f2a79611f5442eb60918eac22b003366880/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T13:48:38Z","email":"openhands@all-hands.dev","name":"openhands"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T13:48:38Z","email":"openhands@all-hands.dev","name":"openhands"},"message":"Add show/hide toggle to password fields\n\nNew PasswordInput component (client/src/components/ui/password-input.tsx) wraps\nthe shared input and adds an eye / eye-off button that flips the field between\npassword and text. It forwards refs and props like Input, so react-hook-form\nFormControl and plain controlled fields both work unchanged.\n\nDetails:\n- type=\"button\" on the toggle: a bare <button> in a <form> defaults to submit\n  and would have sent the form on every reveal.\n- tabIndex={-1} keeps tab order on the field rather than the decoration, and\n  aria-label/aria-pressed report the state to screen readers.\n- pr-10 reserves room for the icon so long values do not run underneath it.\n- Disabled state is passed through, so the button dims with its input.\n\nConverted every password field, which also covers the reset, register, admin\nlogin and admin change-password forms: login.tsx (4 fields),\nreset-password.tsx, create-admin.tsx, admin-login-page.tsx and admin-info.tsx\n(2 fields). No page renders a bare type=\"password\" any more, so the toggle\ncannot be forgotten in a new form without failing the test.\n\nTests: tests/password-input.test.mjs pins the type swap, the icons, aria state,\ntype=\"button\", ref forwarding, and scans client/src/pages for regressions.","tree":{"sha":"f9c30029eb090cedbd01c6e4e7b48ca9bfd4df42","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ProjectHub-fie/ProjectHub/git/trees/f9c30029eb090cedbd01c6e4e7b48ca9bfd4df42"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ProjectHub-fie/ProjectHub/git/commits/e5c30f2a79611f5442eb60918eac22b003366880","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/175740463?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/openhands-agent","id":175740463,"login":"openhands-agent","node_id":"U_kgDOCnmWLw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ProjectHub-fie/ProjectHub/commit/e5c30f2a79611f5442eb60918eac22b003366880","node_id":"C_kwDOPjAFOtoAKGU1YzMwZjJhNzk2MTFmNTQ0MmViNjA5MThlYWMyMmIwMDMzNjY4ODA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ProjectHub-fie/ProjectHub/commit/61367f333983c8d7b1ce4772c7bcc84b7f943c8c","sha":"61367f333983c8d7b1ce4772c7bcc84b7f943c8c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ProjectHub-fie/ProjectHub/commits/61367f333983c8d7b1ce4772c7bcc84b7f943c8c"}],"sha":"e5c30f2a79611f5442eb60918eac22b003366880","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ProjectHub-fie/ProjectHub/commits/e5c30f2a79611f5442eb60918eac22b003366880"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/175740463?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/openhands-agent","id":175740463,"login":"openhands-agent","node_id":"U_kgDOCnmWLw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ProjectHub-fie/ProjectHub/commits/61367f333983c8d7b1ce4772c7bcc84b7f943c8c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T10:20:01Z","email":"openhands@all-hands.dev","name":"openhands"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T10:20:01Z","email":"openhands@all-hands.dev","name":"openhands"},"message":"Fix auth: Mailjet reset email, Discord OAuth session, global auth state, profile menu\n\nPassword reset / email:\n- Replace Resend with Mailjet Email Send API v3.1 in api/lib/email.js; drop the\n  resend dependency. Server-side only keys MJ_APIKEY_PUBLIC/PRIVATE, MJ_SENDER_EMAIL,\n  MJ_SENDER_NAME; MJ_SENDER_EMAIL is required (validated sender), never a guess.\n- Recovery handler reports a real failure when the send fails and stays vague for\n  unknown accounts, so enumeration is not possible.\n- Map /api/auth/forgot-password and /api/auth/reset-password onto the recovery\n  handler; they previously 404''d. Verify Turnstile as login does.\n\nDiscord OAuth:\n- Route /api/auth/discord and /api/auth/discord/callback before the generic\n  /api/auth/ catch-all, which was answering the callback with ''Auth endpoint\n  not found'' and never establishing a session.\n- Add PKCE plus a signed state nonce; token exchange stays server-side.\n- Establish the same signed session as password login (HttpOnly cookie + token),\n  clear the helper cookies, and redirect to /dashboard.\n- Match by Discord id first, then link by email, so no duplicate user per callback.\n\nAuth state / profile menu:\n- Centralise auth in a single AuthProvider context with an explicit\n  loading/authenticated/unauthenticated status. Seed from storage so a reload\n  does not flash logged-out, but only /api/auth/me promotes to authenticated.\n- Drive the profile trigger and panel from that status: skeleton while loading,\n  avatar+initials and Log out when signed in, placeholder and Log in otherwise.\n- Logout invalidates the server session, drops the token/user, clears cached\n  queries and bumps a generation so an in-flight /me cannot restore it.\n\nCaching / env:\n- Mark /api/auth/* and /api/project-requests no-store in vercel.json so a Vercel\n  function''s default public caching cannot serve one visitor''s state to another.\n- Document Mailjet and APP_ORIGIN; remove the stale NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL/RESEND\n  guidance.\n\nTests: Mailjet email tests, new discord-session suite, expanded client-auth\nprovider/avatar/logout coverage, session cache-control assertion.","tree":{"sha":"c61b3a8ca2e38ff67bbffab6308f3cd7982a305d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ProjectHub-fie/ProjectHub/git/trees/c61b3a8ca2e38ff67bbffab6308f3cd7982a305d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ProjectHub-fie/ProjectHub/git/commits/61367f333983c8d7b1ce4772c7bcc84b7f943c8c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/175740463?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/openhands-agent","id":175740463,"login":"openhands-agent","node_id":"U_kgDOCnmWLw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ProjectHub-fie/ProjectHub/commit/61367f333983c8d7b1ce4772c7bcc84b7f943c8c","node_id":"C_kwDOPjAFOtoAKDYxMzY3ZjMzMzk4M2M4ZDdiMWNlNDc3MmM3YmNjODRiN2Y5NDNjOGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ProjectHub-fie/ProjectHub/commit/c608710dc9e78d1e546c83df4e3a34e9a101d567","sha":"c608710dc9e78d1e546c83df4e3a34e9a101d567","url":"https://ap