id":"U_kgDOCnmWLw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ProjectHub-fie/ProjectHub/commits/ab9bac6ae476e67b61bed1871a2a4cb14deb9b18/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T09:19:17Z","email":"openhands@all-hands.dev","name":"openhands"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T09:19:17Z","email":"openhands@all-hands.dev","name":"openhands"},"message":"fix(portal): unblock profile dropdown, avatar upload and Discord sign-in\n\nClient website\n- The profile dropdown was unclickable on `/`: the hero''s `absolute inset-0`\n  overlay painted over the header and swallowed pointer events. The header now\n  establishes its own stacking context (`relative z-40`), so the menu is\n  hit-testable on every route instead of only /projects, /dashboard and /404.\n- The profile-picture upload posted to /api/auth/upload-profile-pic, a route\n  neither backend implements, so the chosen file was stored nowhere and the\n  avatar never changed. The image is now read as a data URL and saved through\n  the existing profile endpoint, with the size cap lowered to 2MB so the\n  base64 body still clears the deployment''s request limit.\n- Removed the per-page Logout button from the client dashboard; logout stays in\n  the sidebar, which is the only place the website and dashboard share.\n- \"Continue with Discord\" moved above the login/register tabs.\n\nDiscord OAuth\n- The callback redirected on ten different failures without logging once, so a\n  rotated secret produced no server output at all. Every exit now logs its\n  reason (and the OAuth error description), which is what surfaced that the\n  client secret in the environment was stale.\n- The handshake navigated to /dashboard unconditionally after storing the\n  token. An unrecognised token was dropped on a protected route and bounced\n  straight back, appearing as \"signed in but nothing happened\". The redirect\n  is now conditional on the token actually resolving, with a toast otherwise.\n\nContact form\n- The serverless handler demanded CONTACT_TO_EMAIL or OWNER_EMAIL and answered\n  502 when neither was set, while the Express route already defaulted. Both now\n  share `contactRecipient()`, so notifications have a destination and the error\n  is truthful when mail is genuinely unconfigured.\n\nTests: adds tests/portal-ui.test.mjs pinning the header stacking context, the\nupload path, the conditional Discord redirect, the button placement and the\ndashboard logout removal.","tree":{"sha":"9b4d56f23fd8c47469c7c637dc907c6ca3ef185f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ProjectHub-fie/ProjectHub/git/trees/9b4d56f23fd8c47469c7c637dc907c6ca3ef185f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ProjectHub-fie/ProjectHub/git/commits/ab9bac6ae476e67b61bed1871a2a4cb14deb9b18","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/175740463?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/openhands-agent","id":175740463,"login":"openhands-agent","node_id":"U_kgDOCnmWLw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.