","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ProjectHub-fie/ProjectHub/commits/64eff2a341558f7401ed715e81728fae5fa655f8"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/ProjectHub-fie/ProjectHub/commit/f250eef9e1333a91f8535737404437753d90879a","sha":"f250eef9e1333a91f8535737404437753d90879a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ProjectHub-fie/ProjectHub/commits/f250eef9e1333a91f8535737404437753d90879a"}],"sha":"8ae5b4760bee3561f83594adfbbf074ac3a9eeba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ProjectHub-fie/ProjectHub/commits/8ae5b4760bee3561f83594adfbbf074ac3a9eeba"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/175740463?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/openhands-agent","id":175740463,"login":"openhands-agent","node_id":"U_kgDOCnmWLw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ProjectHub-fie/ProjectHub/commits/f250eef9e1333a91f8535737404437753d90879a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T03:49:59Z","email":"openhands@all-hands.dev","name":"openhands"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T03:50:49Z","email":"openhands@all-hands.dev","name":"openhands"},"message":"Add db:bootstrap for building the schema on an empty database\n\nThere was no working path to create this schema from scratch, which is why a\nfresh Neon database came up with no tables.\n\n`drizzle-kit migrate` cannot do it: meta/_journal.json registers only 3 of the\n10 SQL files (0000, 0001, 0008) and its entries carry no `hash`, so migrate\nwould replay 0000 - whose project_request_status enum still has the old value\nset that 0008 replaces - and never reach 0009_admin_credentials.sql.\n\n`drizzle-kit push` is not a safe substitute. It matches unmanaged tables as\nrename candidates, and every Neon database ships a `playing_with_neon` sample\ntable, so an unattended push offers to rename it into admin_credentials.\n\nscripts/db-bootstrap.mjs derives the DDL from drizzle/schema.ts through\n`drizzle-kit generate`, so it cannot drift from the schema, and applies it\nidempotently. Already-present errors (42P07, 42710, 42701, 42P16) are skipped,\nso re-running is a no-op, and it verifies the six application tables exist\nafterwards.\n\nVerified: against an empty database it applies 11/11 statements and the app''s\nGET /api/projects returns the 6 seeded projects; a second run applies 0 and\nreports all tables present; tsc is clean. Admin accounts stay with the\nexisting scripts/seed-admin.mjs, now wired up as db:seed-admin.","tree":{"sha":"f8f05e27330a83ff232168a80de2c54e7b50feae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ProjectHub-fie/ProjectHub/git/trees/f8f05e27330a83ff232168a80de2c54e7b50feae"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ProjectHub-fie/ProjectHub/git/commits/f250eef9e1333a91f8535737404437753d90879a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/175740463?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"ht