64eff2a341558f7401ed715e81728fae5fa655f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ProjectHub-fie/ProjectHub/commits/64eff2a341558f7401ed715e81728fae5fa655f8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/175740463?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/openhands-agent","id":175740463,"login":"openhands-agent","node_id":"U_kgDOCnmWLw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ProjectHub-fie/ProjectHub/commits/43d3d72ad14d735020c7c870cedfeed12070fb67/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T16:28:35Z","email":"openhands@all-hands.dev","name":"openhands"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T16:28:35Z","email":"openhands@all-hands.dev","name":"openhands"},"message":"Revert the pnpm_workspace scaffold and restore the Vercel application\n\nReverts 235ad27 and def1187 (\"Apply pnpm_workspace migration scaffold\",\n\"rebase\"), returning the tree to 9377bd1, the merge of PR #3.\n\nThe scaffold switched the repo to Replit (deploymentTarget = \"autoscale\",\nno root vercel.json) and left an empty shell behind:\n\n- artifacts/api-server/src/routes/ had exactly one route, /healthz\n- lib/db/src/schema/index.ts was `export {}`; no verified_projects table\n  and no users table existed anywhere in the live tree\n- artifacts/dev-project-hub/src/** was a byte-identical copy of the pre-PR\n  files (md5-verified against 4eb2dfc), so the merged Discord login and\n  sidebar work were absent from the live artifact\n- the client still called ~20 API endpoints that had no routes\n\nNothing was lost: the old code had been moved to .migration-backup/ as\nR100 renames. This restores it to its original paths, along with vercel.json\nand the /api serverless functions.\n\nAlso untracks .env, .env.vercel, cookies.txt, fresh-cookies.txt,\ntest-cookies.txt and vercel-env-example.txt, and adds them to .gitignore.\nThey hold live DATABASE_URL, SESSION_SECRET, RESEND_API_KEY, MAILJET\ncredentials and session cookies, and were committed to a public repository\nbefore the ignore rules existed. Local copies are retained.\n\nThe values remain in prior history and must still be rotated; untracking\ndoes not remove them from history. SESSION_SECRET is the priority since it\nsigns session tokens.\n\nVerified: tsc --noEmit clean, vite build succeeds.","tree":{"sha":"b16545196dcb673532d71f5fcb7002367eb151c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ProjectHub-fie/ProjectHub/git/trees/b16545196dcb673532d71f5fcb7002367eb151c7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ProjectHub-fie/ProjectHub/git/commits/43d3d72ad14d735020c7c870cedfeed12070fb67","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/175740463?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openhands-agent/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/openhands-agent","id":175740463,"login":"openhands-