 system is now fully functional and optimized!","tree":{"sha":"e6eff67428a6cff87305677b911464b6fb05e50b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jonmatum/terminal-ui-poc/git/trees/e6eff67428a6cff87305677b911464b6fb05e50b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jonmatum/terminal-ui-poc/git/commits/abe8ddc70ee615f9ae3b59858bdf096daa4f8263","verification":{"payload":"tree e6eff67428a6cff87305677b911464b6fb05e50b\nparent e2ee78f51edaa8d2db5ea925f5c10c3cd04e8c5f\nauthor Jonatan Mata <jonmatum@gmail.com> 1755973623 -0600\ncommitter Jonatan Mata <jonmatum@gmail.com> 1755973623 -0600\n\nfix: resolve tsup build issues and optimize package exports\n\nBUILD SYSTEM FIXES\n\n## Issues Resolved\n- Fix package.json exports order (types must come first)\n- Fix Text component TypeScript ref typing issue\n- Optimize build configuration for better compatibility\n\n## Build Results\n- CJS: dist/index.js (15.58 KB)\n- ESM: dist/index.mjs (13.40 KB)\n- Types: dist/index.d.ts (5.16 KB)\n- Source maps: Generated for debugging\n- Build time: ~450ms (vs 3-5s with rollup)\n\n## Performance Gains\n- 90% faster builds with esbuild\n- 107 fewer dependencies (removed 182, added 75)\n- Zero configuration required\n- Modern package exports for better bundler compatibility\n\ntsup build system is now fully functional and optimized!\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQQxU9i7BVfNID+dmScV1wjRkLW0pAUCaKoH9wAKCRAV1wjRkLW0\npNCpAQDWFdyKrZtMUV8fQCLK+6wQxwG2hO/liyjC4BA7vn621AEA6lF0f7X1XSMn\n47uvD8lPwtboQPkTc9ZNgajfiixYYgM=\n=wPGJ\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-08-23T22:14:09Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4975788?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonmatum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonmatum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonmatum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonmatum/gists{/gist_id}",