/api.github.com/users/jonmatum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonmatum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jonmatum","id":4975788,"login":"jonmatum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5NzU3ODg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonmatum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonmatum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonmatum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonmatum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonmatum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonmatum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jonmatum/terminal-ui-poc/commits/fdb34652df26cd425e0fba6bbe3e98a3c351645d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-23T18:16:13Z","email":"jonmatum@gmail.com","name":"Jonatan Mata"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-23T18:16:13Z","email":"jonmatum@gmail.com","name":"Jonatan Mata"},"message":"feat: initial terminal ui design system package\n\nCOMPLETE DESIGN SYSTEM PACKAGE CREATED\n\n## Package Overview\n- Name: @jonmatum/terminal-ui\n- Version: 1.0.0\n- Matrix/TRON dual theme system\n- Konami code integration\n- TypeScript first with full type safety\n- Tailwind CSS integration\n- Storybook documentation\n\n## Core Components\n- Button: Terminal-style with 4 variants (primary, secondary, ghost, danger)\n- Card: Container with header, content, footer sub-components\n- Input: Form input with label and helper text\n- Text: Typography with theme variants\n\n## Theme System\n- Matrix Theme: Green (#00ff41) with glow effects and scanlines\n- TRON Theme: Cyan (#00ffff) with orange accents and particles\n- Automatic CSS custom properties generation\n- Component variants that adapt to current theme\n\n## Hooks & Providers\n- ThemeProvider: Context provider with theme state management\n- useTheme: Hook for accessing theme state and controls\n- useKonami: Konami code detection with customizable callbacks\n\n## Development Tools\n- Rollup build system for CJS and ESM outputs\n- TypeScript with declaration files\n- Storybook for component documentation\n- Tailwind CSS with custom terminal styling\n\n## Key Features\n- Micro-frontend ready architecture\n- Professional npm package structure\n- Comprehensive TypeScript types\n- Storybook stories and documentation\n- Clean, DRY component design\n- Konami code theme switching\n- Terminal aesthetic with glow effects\n\nReady for development, testing, and publishing to npm!","tree":{"sha":"808c08dc25618001b5b9c822c492bf3a16baa0ba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jonmatum/terminal-ui-poc/git/trees/808c08dc25618001b5b9c822c492bf3a16baa0ba"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jonmatum/terminal-ui-poc/git/commits/fdb34652df26cd425e0fba6bbe3e98a3c351645d","verification":{"payload":"tree 808c08dc25618001b5b9c822c492bf3a16baa0ba\nauthor Jonatan Mata <jonmatum@gmail.com> 1755972973 -0600\ncommitter Jonatan Mata <jonmatum@gmail.com> 1755972973 -0600\n\nfeat: initial terminal ui design system package\n\nCOMPLETE DESIGN SYSTEM PACKAGE CREATED\n\n## Package Overview\n- Name: @jonmatum/terminal-ui\n- Version: 1.0.0\n- Matrix/TRON dual theme system\n- Konami code integration\n- TypeScript first with full type safety\n- Tailwind CSS integration\n- Storybook documentation\n\n## Core Components\n- Button: Terminal-style with 4 variants (primary, secondary, ghost, danger)\n- Card: Container with header, content, footer sub-components\n- Input: Form input with label and helper text\n- Text: Typography with theme variants\n\n## Theme System\n- Matrix Theme: Green (#00ff41) with glow effects and scanlines\n- TRON Theme: Cyan (#00ffff) with orange accents and particles\n- Automatic CSS custom properties generation\n- Component variants that adapt to current theme\n\n## Hooks & Providers\n- ThemeProvider: Context provider with theme state management\n- useTheme: Hook for accessing theme state and controls\n- useKonami: Konami code detection with customizable callbacks\n\n## Development Tools\n- Rollup build system for CJS and ESM outputs\n- TypeScript with declaration files\n- Storybook for component documentation\n- Tailwind CSS with custom terminal styling\n\n## Key Features\n- Micro-frontend ready architecture\n- Professional npm package structure\n- Comprehensive TypeScript types\n- Storybook stories and documentation\n- Clean, DRY component design\n- Konami code theme switching\n- Terminal aesthetic with glow effects\n\nReady for development, testing, and publishing to npm!\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQQxU9i7BVfNID+dmScV1wjRkLW0pAUCaKoFbQAKCRAV1wjRkLW0\npGhmAQDbeg/RfmkKyoG2ABmId1mZ43AEsoABPj+myCnTF0X4sAEApWbt/3vLJ4iD\nry+zYnmwPQu6cg8GfYZfDGf5p8iH6gA=\n=xPva\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-08-23T22:14:09Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4975788?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonmatum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonmatum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonmatum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonmatum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jonmatum","id":4975788,"login":"jonmatum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5NzU3ODg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonmatum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonmatum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonmatum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonmatum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonmatum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonmatum","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jonmatum/terminal-ui-poc/commit/fdb34652df26cd425e0fba6bbe3e98a3c351645d"