}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adlio/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adlio/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adlio/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adlio","id":27492,"login":"adlio","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3NDky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adlio/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adlio/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adlio/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adlio/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adlio/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adlio","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adlio/heisenberg/commits/dc48aae0cb74af797f86a27f6e5dfb5f4c61dfb2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-07T15:51:14Z","email":"a@adl.io","name":"Aaron Longwell"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-07T15:51:14Z","email":"a@adl.io","name":"Aaron Longwell"},"message":"ci: fail loud on real cargo publish errors\n\nThe previous publish loop swallowed every cargo publish failure with\n\"|| echo skipping\", which masked real errors (auth, metadata, network)\nbehind a green checkmark.\n\nNow we capture the output, distinguish the legitimate ''already uploaded''\ncase (lets us re-run a partially failed release without manual yanking),\nand exit 1 on any other failure so the action turns red.\n\nAlso wraps each crate''s publish in a GitHub Actions log group for easier\nscanning when a release ships multiple crates.","tree":{"sha":"ccb0220dc4d470ea59d71a60958a3c138c472d23","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adlio/heisenberg/git/trees/ccb0220dc4d470ea59d71a60958a3c138c472d23"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adlio/heisenberg/git/commits/dc48aae0cb74af797f86a27f6e5dfb5f4c61dfb2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"ver