MDQ6VXNlcjY0NjE1MjA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tokinonagare/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tokinonagare/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tokinonagare/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tokinonagare/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tokinonagare/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tokinonagare","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tokinonagare/vite-single-spa/commits/40b534bbf6fabceb5a936f251aa75216ee27296c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-25T13:48:50Z","email":"timemahou@gmail.com","name":"Harry"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-25T13:48:50Z","email":"timemahou@gmail.com","name":"Harry"},"message":"feat: 重构微前端架构并重命名全局服务\n\n主要变更：\n- 新增api-services微服务，提供通用HTTP客户端能力\n- 将shared-services重命名为api-services，架构更清晰\n- 重命名全局变量 __SHARED_SERVICES__ → $api，命名更简洁\n- 实现基于Ky的现代HTTP客户端，支持缓存/重试/认证\n- 简化GameApi初始化逻辑，从50+行代码精简到4行\n- 移除复杂的wrapper类，采用直接调用模式\n- 更新所有文档和示例代码，保持一致性\n- 优化FeaturedGames组件，集成真实API数据加载\n\n技术改进：\n- 使用构造函数Promise模式，避免重复客户端创建\n- 集中处理服务等待和重试逻辑到ClientFactory\n- 清晰分离HTTP基础设施和业务逻辑\n- 支持微服务间的标准化HTTP通信\n\n🤖 Generated with Claude Code\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"118592f3b928136a0c2bf1c68ecc0428f29bfb37","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tokinonagare/vite-single-spa/git/trees/118592f3b928136a0c2bf1c68ecc0428f29bfb37"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tokinonagare/vite-single-spa/git/commits/40b534bbf6fabceb5a936f251aa75216ee27296c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6461520?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tokinonagare/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tokinonagare/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.co